			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>7.</b> c. acc.,
				<i>beware of, avoid,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἅπαντα ταῦτα φυλάττειν κελεύει</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					18(2).791
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>8.</b>
