				LXX
				<u>Jo.</u>
				23.11
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>C.</b>
			
				Med.
			, </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>I.</b> abs.,
				<i>to be on one's guard, keep watch,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ec.</u>
				769
			</span></i>; used by <i><span class="en">
				Hom.
			</span></i> only in part., 
