				<u>Cyn.</u>
				10.10
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> c. acc.,
				<i>keep</i> a thing <i>by one, bear</i> it <i>in mind</i>
