        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φυλάσσεσθαί τι</span> or <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινα</span>
